<title>CHILE: Chile's Provida signs insurance contract.</title>
<headline>Chile's Provida signs insurance contract.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean pension fund manager Provida said it has assigned to Aetna Chile Seguros de Vida a life and disability contract for the period August 1, 1997 to July 21, 1999.</p>
<p>The contract includes a maximum rate of 0.8 percent of total salaries with a provisional rate of 0.7 percent, said the statement.</p>
<p>Provida is Chile's largest pension fund manager.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
